{'symbol': 'LOW', 'date': '2021-10-13 08:00:00', 'title': "LOWE'S LAUNCHES LOWE'S ONE ROOF MEDIA NETWORK, A NEW KIND OF RETAIL MEDIA SALES AND MARKETING SERVICE", 'text': "MOORESVILLE, N.C., OCT. 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LOWE'S COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE: LOW) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF LOWE'S ONE ROOF MEDIA NETWORK, A RETAIL MEDIA SERVICE PROVIDING AN EXTENSIVE PORTFOLIO OF OMNICHANNEL ADVERTISING SERVICES DESIGNED TO PUT BRANDS AT THE FOREFRONT OF THE HOME LIFESTYLE MOVEMENT."}